\newlabel{fig:exctx}{{7}{8}{\textbf {Supervising context biasing.} Under a wrong-user profile, the matched-only model writes the profile's email instead of the audio's (copying); the counterfactually trained release follows the audio. Outputs from the recorded spelled-entity probes.\relax }{figure.caption.10}{}}
