\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {The supervision-composition record.} Eight compositions, one architecture, compressed into six rows: rows 1 and 2 each span two iterations (a data scale-up; a truncation-dose increase), and each later row adds one labeled pool to the mix above it, except row 6, which \emph  {replaces} row 5's same-audio hold pool with disjoint audio. ``Early'' latencies are negative: the model fires seconds before the turn ends. Row 7 is the causal recipe of \S  \ref  {sec:recipe}.\relax }}{13}{table.caption.21}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:composition}{{4}{13}{\textbf {The supervision-composition record.} Eight compositions, one architecture, compressed into six rows: rows 1 and 2 each span two iterations (a data scale-up; a truncation-dose increase), and each later row adds one labeled pool to the mix above it, except row 6, which \emph {replaces} row 5's same-audio hold pool with disjoint audio. ``Early'' latencies are negative: the model fires seconds before the turn ends. Row 7 is the causal recipe of \S \ref {sec:recipe}.\relax }{table.caption.21}{}}
