\newlabel{fig:markerprob}{{15}{28}{\textbf {Two modes in the weights, not a wobbling threshold.} Mean marker-commit probability $P_{\text {fire}}$ for fire-labeled (complete utterance) and hold-labeled (incomplete) holdout examples across the opposed-pools run; small dots are per-example values. The two classes swing in lockstep as the weights cycle between the fire mode and the no-fire mode; no example hovers persistently at the 0.5 decision boundary.\relax }{figure.caption.59}{}}
